Getting-Started:

You can search any topic from the manual by typing the topic name after
the '>' mark, you will get a message like the following:

[+] Matched Topic: If the exact topic found, it will be directly shown.
[-] Relative Topics: If relative topics instead found, they will be shown
    then you can enter the number of topic represented immediately after
    when '>' appears to get that topic. Else, type 'skip' to skip the 
    entire search and return back to command interface.

NOTE: Searching algorithms are still a subject under development, no exact
      guaurantees that the exact topic will be shown, for further search, 
      use 'Search-Topic' commmand.